    "group": "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters",
    "summary": "When your Command phase begins, you can activate a Mission Tactic you have yet to use this battle. Each option affects all your DEATHWATCH units, and ends as your following Command phase starts. Under Furor Tactics, their weapons gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1]. Under Malleus Tactics, their weapons gain [LETHAL HITS]. Under Purgatus Tactics, a Critical Wound from an attacking DEATHWATCH model in your army gives [PRECISION] to that attack.",
